{"_v":1,"id":"a-bronx-tale-the-musical-2016","cat":"broadway","cs":60.81,"rc":8,"bd":{"positive":2,"mixed":4,"negative":2},"rv":[{"cn":"Chris Jones","o":"Chicago Tribune","s":64,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.chicagotribune.com/entertainment/theater/broadway/sc-bronx-tale-broadway-review-ent-1201-20161201-column.html","d":"2016-12-01","q":"\"A Bronx Tale\" is a wildly uneven show — some parts feel just ridiculous in the broadness of their strokes, others entirely charming."},{"cn":"Alexis Soloski","o":"The Guardian","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2016/dec/02/a-bronx-tale-the-musical-review-new-york-robert-de-niro","d":"2016-12-02","q":"Mostly the piece is too convinced of its own easy dictums."},{"cn":"Adam Feldman","o":"Time Out New York","s":40,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/newyork/theater/a-bronx-tale-the-musical","d":"2016-12-02","q":"A pleasant but unexceptional musical adaptation of a beloved story."},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"http://talkinbroadway.com/page2/world3204.html","d":"2016-12-02","q":"A Bronx Tale is a show that knows exactly what it wants to be and executes that vision with considerable skill and heart."},{"cn":"Steven Suskin","o":"HuffPost","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.huffpost.com/steven-suskin/aisle-view-doo-wop-on-the_b_13361886.html","d":"2016-12-02","q":"Too many of the songs are inconsequential, which serves to dilute those ingratiating, low-brow, mob-infused charms which won audiences over in the first (and second) place."},{"cn":"Elysa Gardner","o":"Entertainment Weekly","s":66,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"http://www.ew.com/article/2016/12/01/bronx-tale-ew-stage-review","d":"2016-12-01","q":"Chances are this Bronx Tale won’t move you to tears, but Trujillo ensures that it will at least move you a little."},{"cn":"Robert Feldberg","o":"NorthJersey.com","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.northjersey.com/story/entertainment/theater/2016/12/02/theater-review-bronx-tale/94677656/","d":"2016-12-02","q":"It just doesn’t seem a necessary one."},{"cn":"Dave Quinn","o":"NBC New York","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.nbcnewyork.com/entertainment/the-scene/A-Bronx-Stale-Robert-De-Niros-Broadway-Directorial-Debut-Falls-Flat-404131806.html","d":"2016-12-01","q":"Despite the best efforts of its cast and creative team, this once-exciting story comes across stale and banal."}],"au":{"score":70,"designation":"Shrugging","sources":{"mz":{"s":70,"c":206,"sr":3.5}}},"cn":{"t":"Critics find this musical adaptation of Palminteri's story moderately enjoyable but unnecessary, with its nostalgic mob-tale charms undermined by forgettable songs that interrupt rather than enhance the familiar narrative.","rc":8},"bo":{"tw":null,"at":{"g":68722973,"p":728,"a":682876}},"ta":"220 W 48th St, New York, NY 10036","vs":{"sl":4,"so":4,"co":3,"am":4,"fa":3},"pd":"2016-11-03","ca":[{"n":"Nick Cordero","r":"Sonny"},{"n":"Richard H. Blake","r":"Lorenzo"},{"n":"Ariana DeBose","r":"Jane"},{"n":"Lucia Giannetta","r":"Rosina"},{"n":"Bradley Gibson","r":"Tyrone"},{"n":"Hudson Loverro","r":"Young Calogero"},{"n":"Bobby Conte Thornton","r":"Calogero"},{"n":"Gilbert L. Bailey II","r":"Jesse"},{"n":"Joe Barbara","r":"Police Officer"},{"n":"Michael Barra","r":"JoJo the Whale"},{"n":"Jonathan Brody","r":"Eddie Mush"},{"n":"Ted Brunetti","r":"Frankie Coffeecake"},{"n":"Brittany Conigatti","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Kaleigh Cronin","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Trista Dollison","r":"Frieda"},{"n":"David Michael Garry","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Rory Max Kaplan","r":"Handsome Nick"},{"n":"Dominic Nolfi","r":"Crazy Mario"},{"n":"Christiani Pitts","r":"Denise"},{"n":"Paul Salvatoriello","r":"Tony-Ten-To-Two"},{"n":"Joey Sorge","r":"Rudy the Voice"},{"n":"Athan Sporek","r":"Young Calogero"},{"n":"Cary Tedder","r":"Doo-Wop Guy"},{"n":"Kirstin Tucker","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Keith White","r":"Sally Slick"}]}